{"blocks": [{"type": "paragraph", "text": "ｸﾞﾙｸﾞﾙ"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "ｶﾞﾗｶﾞﾗｶﾞﾗｶﾞﾗ  ..."}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "ﾊﾟｶｯ   !!"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "ｼﾞｬｼﾞｬｰﾝ"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "∧＿∧           ╭◜◝   ◜◝   ◜◝ ╮"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "‎꒰ ˶ ɞ̴̶̷ ༝ ɞ̴̶̷ ˶꒱ .oO イチャイチャｲﾁｬｲﾁｬ..."}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "‎  /づ~‎🩷         ╰◟◞   ◟◞   ◟◞ ╯"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "神奈川県出身 21歳"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "日向坂46  五期生のまつおさくらです。"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "ブログを開いて下さり本当に本当にありがとうございます。"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "さっきぶりです。"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "イチャイチャ虫！"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "MVが公開されました！"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "120万回再生ありがとうございます！"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "みてない方はもちろん"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "見たよって方ももう1回！"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "🔗https://youtu.be/mgFUz_c4ToM"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "この風船"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "ハートだよ....！"}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://cdn.hinatazaka46.com/files/14/diary/official/member/moblog/202609/mobU0ycPS.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "けど正直"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "ハートに見えない瞬間沢山あった"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "持ってる私は嬉しそうだけど"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "この角度もハートに見えない"}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://cdn.hinatazaka46.com/files/14/diary/official/member/moblog/202609/mobNAJaGa.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "けどこの風船みたいに、"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "一度心の中に"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "『この風船はハートの形をしているんだ』"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "って事実が埋め込めれれば、別に横から見てハートじゃなくても大丈夫"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "ハートっていう事実は消えないから"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "人間もおなじ"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "上手くいかない、"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "この日は調子が悪かった"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "何もかもが嫌になった、"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "この時、この人から見た時の自分の見え方最悪だ、、って思っても大丈夫"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "きっとあなたの本当の部分を知ってくれている人は沢山いるし、"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "私が見ているから！"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "今読んでくれているあなたは"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "きっと良い人。"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "優しい人。"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "イチャイチャ虫も"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "おんなじ"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "その時その時のあなたも大事、"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "他人からの見え方も大事、"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "けどそれより"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "ありのままのあなたを愛してあげて。"}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://cdn.hinatazaka46.com/files/14/diary/official/member/moblog/202609/mobuZx8ND.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://cdn.hinatazaka46.com/files/14/diary/official/member/moblog/202609/mobuYJzBs.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "わたしは、"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "ぬい活してる時の自分すき"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "だれに邪魔されても"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "ありのままでいられるから〜"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "カフェのお客さん役のとき"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "もう役じゃない、私のままだった"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "カフェ好きだし、着てるお洋服も、好きな感じだし"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "ありのままの私を許してくれる"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "この環境もだいすき〜"}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://cdn.hinatazaka46.com/files/14/diary/official/member/moblog/202609/mobQbfbGp.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://cdn.hinatazaka46.com/files/14/diary/official/member/moblog/202609/mobTDW28e.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://cdn.hinatazaka46.com/files/14/diary/official/member/moblog/202609/mobyC3mxs.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://cdn.hinatazaka46.com/files/14/diary/official/member/moblog/202609/mobk3TrRR.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "たくさんの愛に囲まれてる！"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "第二弾を出す予定！なくらい"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "写真たーくさん撮った！"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "まだまだあります！"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "お楽しみに〜"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "ちなみに"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "ロマンティックあげるよ"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "ですが、"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "ドラゴンボールは分からないです"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "大豆田とわ子と三人の元夫"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "を最近みてます！"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "そこで松たか子さんが歌ってたので、"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "最近の気になりソングです"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "🔗https://youtu.be/mgFUz_c4ToM"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "あ、これはイチャイチャ虫のリンクね"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "もう1回"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "イチャイチャしたいー🎶"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "ぜひ聴いてください"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "お仕事、生活、学校、色々あった方は、お疲れ様！また明日も一緒に頑張ろうねー！"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "これからお仕事や予定がある方も一緒に頑張ろー！🌟"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "私が頑張れー！！！"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "ってずーっと応援しているよ"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "あなたの頑張りは桜が見ているからね。"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "明日も素敵な一日になりますように。"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "読んでくれて本当にありがとう！！！！"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "またね"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "明日も元気にさくラブリー ( ̳- ·̫ - ̳ˆ )◞❤︎"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "#sakulovelog"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "101さく"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "わん"}], "source": "official"}